History
2026-11-19: Removed siderolabs/libvirtd (both) and siderolabs/zfs (AMD). Their services never start without extra
config (libvirtd waits on /etc/passwd, zfs on /dev/zfs since the module isn't loaded), which blocks the boot sequence
and Talos reboots the node after its ~70 min boot timeout. KubeVirt doesn't need host libvirtd. If an extension is
ever added back, confirm `talosctl get machinestatus` shows stage "running" afterwards.
